    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>a small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a packing unit of soap | small flask, as a measure of soap (OED s.v. flasket 1 c) | small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a packing unit of white soap, almonds | a small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a packing unit (measure?) of soap | a small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a packing unit for dry goods of no particular size | a small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a packing unit of soap (containing 125 lb.) | a small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a measure unit of soap (containing 125 lb.) | a small flask (OED s.v. flasket 1 c), here as a measuring unit of soap (containing 125 lb.)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
